uid "62234d9b-3ff8-5dee-be89-1c1d5b6dd819" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558054} {:answer/id #uuid "866e0b05-b024-55d0-8a3f-62466373e6a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558128} {:answer/id #uuid "889f2966-4db1-50d6-bdba-0e3b448a1612" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558136} {:answer/id #uuid "bf24cb5e-e54e-5a7c-9d8c-7ebfad3e054d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558248} {:answer/id #uuid "c50bf8df-0f2b-5c83-8628-bfa7b5ba4e93" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558262}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186558128} :answer-field/id #uuid "b7d6781d-d547-56fd-9e7f-2384c91a2d7d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558445}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "09df5c68-2443-52f1-a65f-9fa7f277dc7e" :question/math-academy-id "q-114234" :question/problem "![](images/f2/f22a6d45ad99fa601f45df6d32451c9d004726299130aeb3c6d85e341b275f42.png)\n\nGiven the diagram shown above, what is the value of $x?$" :question/worked-solution "By the segment addition postulate, we have\n\n$$\nAD=AB+BC+CD.\n$$\n\nTo solve for $x,$ we can substitute the given information\n\n$$\nAD=11,\\,AB=2x+3,\\,BC=1-6x,\\,CD=3,\n$$\n\n  \n\nand then solve the resulting equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AD & =AB+BC+CD \\\\ 11 & =(2x+3)+(1-6x)+3 \\\\ 11 & =-4x+7 \\\\ 4x & =-4 \\\\ x & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "09de0a38-4cd9-52e8-a3ce-8c1afd886d96"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186558652 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186558499 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0adfc78d-b274-52a3-b385-1cc24a0e4547" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 